Stable-use baseline is source4ef93d1. No Verona runtime was found before edits.
Development uses owned isolated browser/native profiles, ephemeral loopback
servers and private synthesis/derived-cache outputs; assets are read-only.
CPU/GPU/compositor are shared, so cadence is environment-qualified only.

